  "policies": [
    "Tunneling Geomancer uses native Prepare hand action/DECK_ACTION_COST1 and Spell Damage1. The full raw record and official text specify Prepare despite a missing PREPARE main tag; preserve raw rather than fabricate it.",
    "Scaled Lancer contributes continuous Taunt only to the active enemy-minion board relative to its current controller. Minimal native enemy_minions aura target uses existing source liveness, control, silence, copy and dormant policies; no permanent buff or hand/deck grant. Arachnathid includes itself in friendly Poisonous and has native Rush.",
    "Story of Amara uses existing ordinary SetStats(health40) on the current own Hero, resetting both local maximum and current health through the ordered stat attachment pipeline. It is not Heal, direct loss or the separately clamped remaining-health assignment. Armor and hero identity stay ordinary. Higher maxima/ongoing maximum modifiers follow the existing stat-layer policy pending CN calibration.",
    "Staff of the Endbringer is the complete3-Mana1-Attack6-durability WEAPON; raw/API HEALTH6 is weapon durability, not a six-Health minion. Its actual Deathrattle uses existing DestroyBatch over all active ordinary minions of both boards, excluding dormant and locations. Weapon break/equipment replacement, death ordering and repeats remain shared.",
    "Troubled Double uses native Stealth and its independent Combo entry. It copies the original current continuous board source via existing BoardPresenceReference/CopyMinion and SummonCause. Unprimed plays/effect summons are not Combo, and capacity/payment/repetition stay in the common pipeline.",
    "SI:7 Supplier uses the existing completed character-attack window/cursor and living-source policy, only for its own attack, followed by ordinary Draw. Another attacker or a cancelled/incomplete declaration does not grant it; exact mutual-lethal/source timing remains the existing M6 attack policy.",
    "Story of Galvadon uses existing GrantRandomBonusEffects3 on a selected minion. Existing complete8 board pool, distinct current effects, readiness-based Rush, spell targeting and sequential reactions stay shared; it is not native HAND-slot rotation.",
    "Timeless Causality uses an actual fresh body view and existing ReorderZone over the reversed complete physical DECK order. No shuffle/randomness, new entities, zone re-entry, lost parameters or private permutation is introduced. Original identity/knowledge and replay remain shared.",
    "Both Story spells are ordinary collectible roots in the fixed data/API, not assumed Fabled companions. Event/card availability and complete Standard legality are separate M0 obligations. Card-face/metadata comparison and internal behavior tests do not certify CN timing or close full pools.",
    "Living Plague/Nythendra source requirements and all other Standard roots remain in scope; no unknown root or candidate was removed. No partial executable global generation pool opened."
  ]
}
